    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丹丹：今天怎么突然这么热！",
      "traditional": "丹丹：今天怎麼突然這麼熱！",
      "pinyin": "dān dān jīn tiān zěn me tū rán zhè me rè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dandan: Why is it suddenly so hot today!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "圆圆：是啊，昨天还下雨呢！",
      "traditional": "圓圓：是啊，昨天還下雨呢！",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán shì a zuó tiān hái xià yǔ ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: Yeah. It was raining yesterday!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丹丹：现在的天气变得太快了，都不知道怎么穿衣服了！",
      "traditional": "丹丹：現在的天氣變得太快了，都不知道怎麼穿衣服了！",
      "pinyin": "dān dān xiàn zài de tiān qì biàn de tài kuài le dōu bù zhī dào zěn me chuān yī fu le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dandan: The weather nowadays changes so fast. I literally have no idea what to put on!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "圆圆：今天我看见路上有穿羽绒服的，也有穿短裙的，",
      "traditional": "圓圓：今天我看見路上有穿羽絨服的，也有穿短裙的，",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán jīn tiān wǒ kàn jiàn lù shang yǒu chuān yǔ róng fú de yě yǒu chuān duǎn qún de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "真的是两个季节啊！",
      "traditional": "真的是兩個季節啊！",
      "pinyin": "zhēn de shì liǎng ge jì jié a",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: Today on the street I saw people wearing both feather down coats and short skirts."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Really two different seasons!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "丹丹：现在温差特别大，早上冻成狗，中午热成狗！",
      "traditional": "丹丹：現在溫差特別大，早上凍成狗，中午熱成狗！",
      "pinyin": "dān dān xiàn zài wēn chā tè bié dà zǎo shang dòng chéng gǒu zhōng wǔ rè chéng gǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dandan: The temperature difference is quite big now. Freezing cold in the morning, burning hot at noon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "圆圆：是啊。不过，“冻成狗”和“热成狗”是什么意思？",
      "traditional": "圓圓：是啊。不過，“凍成狗”和“熱成狗”是什麼意思？",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán shì a bú guò dòng chéng gǒu hé rè chéng gǒu shì shén me yì si",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: Yeah, but what do you mean by “freezing like a dog” and “warm like a dog”?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "丹丹：意思就是“非常冷”和“非常热”。你可以用“成狗”表示“非常”。",
      "traditional": "丹丹：意思就是“非常冷”和“非常熱”。你可以用“成狗”表示“非常”。",
      "pinyin": "dān dān yì si jiù shì fēi cháng lěng hé fēi cháng rè nǐ kě yǐ yòng chéng gǒu biǎo shì fēi cháng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dandan: I mean “very cold” and “very warm”. You can use “like a dog” to express “very”."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "圆圆：哦，我明白了。我昨天熬夜了，现在困成狗！",
      "traditional": "圓圓：哦，我明白了。我昨天熬夜了，現在睏成狗！",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán ò wǒ míng bai le wǒ zuó tiān áo yè le xiàn zài kùn chéng gǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: I understand. I stayed up late last night. Right now I am dead tired!"
    }
  ],
